<div dir="auto">Overview</div>
<div dir="auto">At Lucky Made Apps, we prioritize your privacy. Ultra Minimal speedometer is designed with absolute privacy in mind. We do not collect, transmit, store, share, or process any personal or sensitive user data whatsoever.</div>
<div dir="auto">Data Collection and Usage</div>
